4    Sophomore
Name: Grade, dtype: category
Categories (4, object): ['Freshman', 'Junior', 'Senior', 'Sophomore']
</code></pre>
<p>A categorical <code>Series</code> defines a <code>cat</code> object, much like the <code>str</code> object introduced in the previous chapter. It offers a number of attributes and methods for manipulating categories.</p>
        
